{"page":333,"verses":[{"verse_key":"22:6","surah":22,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ هُوَ ٱلْحَقُّ وَأَنَّهُۥ يُحْىِ ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ وَأَنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"this is because God is the Truth; He brings the dead back to life; He has power over everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِأَنَّ","en_gloss":"(is) because","transliteration":"bi-anna","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah ","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْحَقُّ","en_gloss":"(is) the Truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"And that He","transliteration":"wa-annahu","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُحْىِ","en_gloss":"[He] gives life","transliteration":"yuḥ'yī","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","en_gloss":"(to) the dead","transliteration":"l-mawtā","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"and that He","transliteration":"wa-annahu","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قَدِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Powerful","transliteration":"qadīrun","verse_key":"22:6"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٦","en_gloss":"(6)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:6"}]},{"verse_key":"22:7","surah":22,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ ٱلسَّاعَةَ ءَاتِيَةٌ لَّا رَيْبَ فِيهَا وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَبْعَثُ مَن فِى ٱلْقُبُورِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There is no doubt that the Last Hour is bound to come, nor that God will raise the dead from their graves,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"And that","transliteration":"wa-an