oss":"(is) disgrace","transliteration":"khiz'yun","verse_key":"22:9"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَنُذِيقُهُۥ","en_gloss":"and We will make him taste","transliteration":"wanudhīquhu","verse_key":"22:9"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"22:9"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"22:9"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَذَابَ","en_gloss":"(the) punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","verse_key":"22:9"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْحَرِيقِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Burning Fire","transliteration":"l-ḥarīqi","verse_key":"22:9"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٩","en_gloss":"(9)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:9"}]},{"verse_key":"22:10","surah":22,"ayah":10,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ بِمَا قَدَّمَتْ يَدَاكَ وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَيْسَ بِظَلَّـٰمٍ لِّلْعَبِيدِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[It will be said], ‘This is for what you have stored up with your own hands: God is never unjust to His creatures.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"22:10"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"(is) for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"22:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَدَّمَتْ","en_gloss":"have sent forth","transliteration":"qaddamat","verse_key":"22:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَدَاكَ","en_gloss":"your hands","transliteration":"yadāka","verse_key":"22:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"and that","transliteration":"wa-anna","verse_key":"22:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَيْسَ","en_gloss":"is not","transliteration":"laysa","verse_key":"22:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِظَلَّـٰمٍۢ","en_gloss":"unjust","transliteration":"biẓallāmin","verse_key":"22:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِّلْعَبِيدِ","en_gloss":"to His slaves","transliteration":"lil'ʿabīdi","verse_key":"22:10"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٠","en_gloss":"(10)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:10"}]},{"verse_key":"22:11","surah":22,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ مَن يَعْبُدُ ٱللَّهَ عَلَىٰ حَرْفٍ ۖ فَإِنْ أَصَابَهُۥ خَيْرٌ ٱطْمَأَنَّ بِهِۦ ۖ وَإِنْ أَصَابَتْهُ فِتْنَةٌ ٱنقَلَبَ عَلَىٰ وَجْهِهِۦ خَسِرَ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ هُوَ ٱلْخُسْرَانُ ٱلْمُبِينُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There are also some who serve God with unsteady faith: if something good comes their way, they are satisfied, but if they are tested, they revert to their old ways, losing both this world and the next- that is the clearest loss.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"And among","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(is he) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَعْبُدُ","en_gloss":"worships","transliteration":"yaʿbudu","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَرْفٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"an edge","transliteration":"ḥarfin","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَإِنْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَصَابَهُۥ","en_gloss":"befalls him","transliteration":"aṣābahu","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَيْرٌ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱطْمَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"he is content","transliteration":"iṭ'ma-anna","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَإِنْ","en_gloss":"and if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَصَابَتْهُ","en_gloss":"befalls him","transliteration":"aṣābathu","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فِتْنَةٌ","en_gloss":"a trial","transliteration":"fit'natun","verse_key":"22:11"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱنقَلَبَ","en_gloss":"he turns","transliteration":"inqalaba","verse_key